      "callsToAction": [
        "Colour grading and media effectsReal footage graded with LUT",
        "One shoot, many cutsThe same footage rendered as several ver",
        "Cut to the musicA track analysed for beats and sections, the",
        "A pull request, explainedA code change turned into a review ",
        "Editing on a timelineTrimming, splitting, and retiming a pro",
        "A year in reviewPersonal data turned into a shareable card, ",
        "Watch more finished HyperFrames work",
        "Go further with an existing project"
      ],
      "text": "HyperFrames is an open-source framework that turns HTML into video. You make the request; an AI agent builds an editable project; HyperFrames plays or renders it. ​ What can it make? Every tile below is a finished HyperFrames film. Open one to watch it with sound. Colour grading and media effects Real footage graded with LUTs, curves, and scopes — inside Studio. ▶ Play · 48s One shoot, many cuts The same footage rendered as several vertical videos from one project. ▶ Play · 44s Cut to the music A track analysed for beats and sections, then everything snapped to that grid. ▶ Play · 90s A pull r",
      "layout": "split",
      "assetUrls": [
        "https://static.heygen.ai/hyperframes-oss/docs/images/showcase/journey-introduction-v5-v2.mp4",
        "https://static.heygen.ai/hyperframes-oss/docs/images/showcase/tile-grading-v2.mp4",
